{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026qfNHHVVe961794564192.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>山西長治太行山正值秋色最濃時節，滿山紅葉吸引全國各地遊客前來觀賞。全長三十五公里的太行「天路」沿山脊蜿蜒，是一條山區公路，沿途可看到森林轉為紅、金、綠三色交織的秋景。路線穿越陡峭山峰與深谷，連接沿線景區及傳統村落。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"8505890_山西長治太行「天路」秋色引客 done - 截图1\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-vod-cdn.tvb.com/5798858d5bf642729fd1caf6f093e13e/snapshots/ffd96f75809941bb92ececd1e1d1c88a-00001.jpg\"/></p></p><p></p><p><strong>攝影愛好者每年重遊　清晨出發拍紅葉</strong></p><p></p><p>不少遊客專程為這條路線而來。有攝影愛好者表示，他們一行五人清晨已出發，一車同行，認為這裡秋葉格外美麗，每年都會回來住幾日拍攝紅葉。太行山秋色已成為長治市秋季旅遊的亮點，吸引各地旅客自駕上山，感受層林盡染的季節景致。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T00:52:51.844606+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":233,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T00:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T03:48:25.141939+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T00:46:15.212850+00:00","content_hash":"2ef83368a815e8fc9dc29b883d86ee29a59325c31fdb426ff735e51eb5740ac3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-15T00:52:51.844606+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}